1
00:00:04,438 --> 00:00:06,437
Last week, they had their final date...

2
00:00:06,438 --> 00:00:08,537
before the final decision.

3
00:00:08,538 --> 00:00:10,408
- That was the final date.
- The final date.

4
00:00:10,878 --> 00:00:13,038
Some couples confirmed...

5
00:00:13,378 --> 00:00:14,938
- their feelings for each other.
- Yes.

6
00:00:15,078 --> 00:00:18,418
But for some, they've come to face...

7
00:00:18,748 --> 00:00:20,817
- yet another crisis.
- Everything has been reset.

8
00:00:20,818 --> 00:00:23,087
It seems like that for some.

9
00:00:23,088 --> 00:00:24,317
- But they only have one day left.
- Yes.

10
00:00:24,318 --> 00:00:26,157
The scary fact is,

11
00:00:26,158 --> 00:00:28,287
today is the final episode.

12
00:00:28,288 --> 00:00:30,257
(What a pity.)

13
00:00:30,258 --> 00:00:32,457
The complicated romance at Yeon House...

14
00:00:32,458 --> 00:00:34,198
is finally nearing its end.

15
00:00:34,298 --> 00:00:35,497
Before the final decision,

16
00:00:35,498 --> 00:00:37,197
how will things play out,

17
00:00:37,198 --> 00:00:39,098
and who will end up with who?

18
00:00:39,368 --> 00:00:40,488
We won't know until it ends.

19
00:00:41,238 --> 00:00:45,938
(The final night before the final decision)

20
00:00:46,438 --> 00:00:49,848
(Yun So and Si Won's room)

21
00:00:50,178 --> 00:00:51,318
Did you have fun today?

22
00:00:51,418 --> 00:00:52,548
Today,

23
00:00:53,378 --> 00:00:55,047
we talked about a lot of serious stuff.

24
00:00:55,048 --> 00:00:57,218
- Really?
- Very realistic things.

25
00:00:57,718 --> 00:00:59,218
- Like marriage?
- Yes.

26
00:00:59,958 --> 00:01:02,927
I do think I should talk about it at least once too.

27
00:01:02,928 --> 00:01:04,027
- You haven't, have you?
- No.

28
00:01:04,028 --> 00:01:05,198
But once you talk about it...

29
00:01:05,458 --> 00:01:07,267
I was honestly a bit scared,

30
00:01:07,268 --> 00:01:08,467
so I couldn't bring it up at first.

31
00:01:08,468 --> 00:01:10,168
- Right, me too.
- Because honestly,

32
00:01:10,538 --> 00:01:13,197
we're not seeing each other yet.

33
00:01:13,198 --> 00:01:15,308
- Right.
- To talk about the topic...

34
00:01:16,008 --> 00:01:18,107
It feels like a burden to me,

35
00:01:18,108 --> 00:01:19,537
- to us, honestly.
- Right.

36
00:01:19,538 --> 00:01:20,678
But...

37
00:01:21,978 --> 00:01:23,408
But when you think about it,

38
00:01:23,948 --> 00:01:25,248
from her perspective,

39
00:01:25,648 --> 00:01:28,348
it's natural to talk about it.

40
00:01:28,418 --> 00:01:30,658
If she's someone who wants to get married at some point,

41
00:01:31,118 --> 00:01:34,058
she'd definitely think about that the first thing.

42
00:01:34,858 --> 00:01:37,628
That was what I thought.

43
00:01:38,258 --> 00:01:41,228
He's trying to be in Ju Hee's shoes.

44
00:01:43,368 --> 00:01:45,497
Frankly, I can't say I'd marry her right now.

45
00:01:45,498 --> 00:01:47,767
- Obviously.
- Yes, we can't get married now.

46
00:01:47,768 --> 00:01:49,268
Exactly. It's impossible.

47
00:01:50,408 --> 00:01:52,878
How am I supposed to get through this?

48
00:01:54,178 --> 00:01:55,178
I honestly have no idea.

49
00:01:55,179 --> 00:01:57,848
I don't know what's the best answer I can give her...

50
00:01:58,648 --> 00:01:59,917
in this situation.

51
00:01:59,918 --> 00:02:01,147
(Yun So thinks about the best answer he can give.)

52
00:02:01,148 --> 00:02:02,548
I see.

53
00:02:04,058 --> 00:02:06,087
I don't think Yun So was all that interested in...

54
00:02:06,088 --> 00:02:07,888
the idea of getting married to begin with.

55
00:02:08,428 --> 00:02:11,298
I think that could've brought upon his reaction.

56
00:02:11,398 --> 00:02:12,557
That's right, to be honest.

57
00:02:12,558 --> 00:02:13,728
He's busy having fun.

58
00:02:15,228 --> 00:02:18,998
(Meanwhile, in Ju Hee's room)

59
00:02:19,398 --> 00:02:20,737
Is she crying?

60
00:02:20,738 --> 00:02:22,008
Who? Ju Hee?

61
00:02:23,778 --> 00:02:26,508
(Sitting up)

62
00:02:30,948 --> 00:02:32,017
Why is she crying?

63
00:02:32,018 --> 00:02:35,488
(Ju Hee was crying under the blanket.)

64
00:02:36,248 --> 00:02:41,428
(That afternoon, Ju Hee had a date with Yun So.)

65
00:02:41,928 --> 00:02:45,558
(I feel like our conversation is going nowhere.)

66
00:02:45,858 --> 00:02:50,668
I felt that for you, getting married...

67
00:02:51,238 --> 00:02:54,738
(It looked like you were in a hurry to get married.)

68
00:02:55,068 --> 00:02:57,308
(That's why I'm scared to ask you as well.)

69
00:02:57,508 --> 00:02:58,577
(Thinking)

70
00:02:58,578 --> 00:03:01,248
She must've gotten very hurt then.

71
00:03:01,448 --> 00:03:02,808
That wasn't what he meant.

72
00:03:03,308 --> 00:03:07,047
You should ask and talk it out.

73
00:03:07,048 --> 00:03:08,808
(Her date with Yun So didn't work out well.)

74
00:03:09,118 --> 00:03:10,448
(Knocking)

75
00:03:12,158 --> 00:03:14,088
Is it just Ji Hye inside?

76
00:03:18,698 --> 00:03:19,728
What's wrong?

77
00:03:20,568 --> 00:03:22,028
What's wrong? Are you crying?

78
00:03:28,408 --> 00:03:31,078
No, if she does that, Ju Hee will burst into tears.

79
00:03:33,438 --> 00:03:36,977
(Looking at Ji Seung makes her bottled up emotions emerge again.)

80
00:03:36,978 --> 00:03:40,948
(Looking at Ji Seung makes her bottled up emotions emerge again.)

81
00:03:43,488 --> 00:03:44,488
Why are you crying?

82
00:03:47,288 --> 00:03:48,928
All the older girls are shocked.

83
00:03:49,958 --> 00:03:52,998
I just feel like a complete idiot.

84
00:03:53,758 --> 00:03:55,228
Why do you feel like an idiot?

85
00:03:55,768 --> 00:03:57,837
You're not. Why would you think so?

86
00:03:57,838 --> 00:04:00,938
I lead all our conversations.

87
00:04:01,338 --> 00:04:02,938
When you're with him?

88
00:04:03,438 --> 00:04:06,378
And he says he likes it when I do that.

89
00:04:06,508 --> 00:04:08,577
But when I asked about the future plans,

90
00:04:08,578 --> 00:04:12,877
he kept saying irrelevant things.

91
00:04:12,878 --> 00:04:15,218
It seemed that he felt uncomfortable.

92
00:04:15,888 --> 00:04:18,958
- I don't know what he wants.
- He didn't give you assurance?

93
00:04:19,718 --> 00:04:22,357
- Go on.
- He kept saying it was hard.

94
00:04:22,358 --> 00:04:24,357
That it was hard to talk about the future.

95
00:04:24,358 --> 00:04:27,797
It's harder to talk about it because he has feelings for me.

96
00:04:27,798 --> 00:04:30,997
I keep saying what I want to say...

97
00:04:30,998 --> 00:04:33,598
and do what I want to do.

98
00:04:33,698 --> 00:04:34,867
He gets flustered,

99
00:04:34,868 --> 00:04:38,008
and my confidence starts to drop.

100
00:04:38,278 --> 00:04:39,654
The misunderstanding is building up.

101
00:04:39,678 --> 00:04:43,407
One thing I felt clearly is...

102
00:04:43,408 --> 00:04:45,878
that it all comes from the experience.

103
00:04:45,978 --> 00:04:47,317
It's not about him as a person.

104
00:04:47,318 --> 00:04:49,248
He could be fine after several years.

105
00:04:49,588 --> 00:04:52,358
But now, he is so inexperienced.

106
00:04:52,588 --> 00:04:55,527
So he'd never act in a way we'd want him to.

107
00:04:55,528 --> 00:04:56,957
- That's right.
- I really tried...

108
00:04:56,958 --> 00:05:01,668
to look past the age.

109
00:05:01,968 --> 00:05:03,868
- And look at the rest.
- But...

110
00:05:06,668 --> 00:05:08,508
I don't know.

111
00:05:12,278 --> 00:05:13,807
(The reality hits her hard on the last night at Yeon House.)

112
00:05:13,808 --> 00:05:15,647
It's a dilemma.

113
00:05:15,648 --> 00:05:16,648
It keeps...

114
00:05:17,348 --> 00:05:20,818
Whether Yun So's words were conveyed right or wrong,

115
00:05:21,118 --> 00:05:22,718
she's come to realize the situation.

116
00:05:23,348 --> 00:05:24,757
At Yeon House,

117
00:05:24,758 --> 00:05:28,058
all the older women and younger men are blooming their love,

118
00:05:28,288 --> 00:05:30,557
so she mustered up some courage.

119
00:05:30,558 --> 00:05:33,357
But that illusion suddenly shattered.

120
00:05:33,358 --> 00:05:34,597
(All her courage disappeared.)

121
00:05:34,598 --> 00:05:36,768
Then they should...

122
00:05:36,928 --> 00:05:39,738
- really level with each other.
- All the more reason to talk.

123
00:05:41,368 --> 00:05:43,267
(The final day at Yeon House has started.)

124
00:05:43,268 --> 00:05:45,308
The final day does come, after all.

125
00:05:46,308 --> 00:05:50,718
(They've only left with the final decision tonight.)

126
00:05:55,148 --> 00:05:59,418
(A message is only sent to the younger men.)

127
00:06:02,928 --> 00:06:04,297
(It's the day of the final decision.)

128
00:06:04,298 --> 00:06:05,727
(Send the name of the older woman you'd like to talk more with.)

129
00:06:05,728 --> 00:06:07,428
There's a date before the final decision?

130
00:06:07,528 --> 00:06:09,568
There should be. They need to talk one last time.

131
00:06:11,198 --> 00:06:13,938
Finally, at the end, the younger men get to choose.

132
00:06:15,968 --> 00:06:17,238
It's the last chance they have.

133
00:06:17,778 --> 00:06:19,337
They need to talk it out well.

134
00:06:19,338 --> 00:06:20,658
They need to resolve every issue.

135
00:06:26,118 --> 00:06:27,178
It's Jin Wu.

136
00:06:28,188 --> 00:06:30,087
I can tell from the back of his head that it's Jin Wu.

137
00:06:30,088 --> 00:06:31,417
I must've gotten very attached to him.

138
00:06:31,418 --> 00:06:34,087
(Jin Wu is waiting for the older woman...)

139
00:06:34,088 --> 00:06:35,658
(to talk with one last time.)

140
00:06:36,228 --> 00:06:42,267
(Which older woman did Jin Wu want to talk with one last time?)

141
00:06:42,268 --> 00:06:44,937
(It's Jin Young.)

142
00:06:44,938 --> 00:06:45,968
Jin Wu.

143
00:06:46,638 --> 00:06:47,768
You're here.

144
00:06:48,008 --> 00:06:49,068
Jin Wu.

145
00:06:49,738 --> 00:06:50,778
You're here.

146
00:06:51,408 --> 00:06:52,537
Did you wait long?

147
00:06:52,538 --> 00:06:53,637
Not so much.

148
00:06:53,638 --> 00:06:54,778
Really?

149
00:06:56,408 --> 00:06:58,248
- Thank you.
- I've already ordered the drink.

150
00:07:03,118 --> 00:07:04,218
Did you expect me here?

151
00:07:04,918 --> 00:07:06,218
- Yes.
- I'm sure you did.

152
00:07:06,358 --> 00:07:08,328
Yes. I knew you'd be here.

153
00:07:09,428 --> 00:07:11,427
How do you feel? Are you okay?

154
00:07:11,428 --> 00:07:12,668
- What?
- Are you feeling okay?

155
00:07:12,998 --> 00:07:15,097
- Am I feeling okay?
- Better than yesterday?

156
00:07:15,098 --> 00:07:16,428
Much better than yesterday.

157
00:07:17,398 --> 00:07:18,498
Yesterday...

158
00:07:20,908 --> 00:07:23,108
Yesterday, it was...

159
00:07:23,168 --> 00:07:25,408
really hard for me.

160
00:07:28,448 --> 00:07:30,248
I wasn't in my right mind.

161
00:07:31,318 --> 00:07:32,418
Really...

162
00:07:33,718 --> 00:07:34,818
You...

163
00:07:35,818 --> 00:07:39,218
You comforting me really helped me a lot.

164
00:07:41,588 --> 00:07:43,588
Thank you for saying that.

165
00:07:45,298 --> 00:07:47,998
- This is embarrassing.
- It really helped a lot.

166
00:07:48,868 --> 00:07:51,397
They've comforted each other.

167
00:07:51,398 --> 00:07:52,867
(Jin Young and Jin Wu found solace in each other.)

168
00:07:52,868 --> 00:07:56,567
When I first got the text to hold the hand of my date...

169
00:07:56,568 --> 00:07:59,277
and leave the place, I thought for a very long time.

170
00:07:59,278 --> 00:08:00,537
- Do you remember?
- Yes. I remember everything.

171
00:08:00,538 --> 00:08:02,847
You remember? I was considering between you and Jun Han.

172
00:08:02,848 --> 00:08:04,077
Did you know that?

173
00:08:04,078 --> 00:08:05,177
- I had no idea.
- Really?

174
00:08:05,178 --> 00:08:07,018
- I thought you'd no interest in me.
- Really?

175
00:08:07,888 --> 00:08:09,528
(The first time Jin Young and Jin Wu met)

176
00:08:10,148 --> 00:08:11,557
(Jin Young could choose her date, )

177
00:08:11,558 --> 00:08:15,058
(and she was torn between Jin Wu and Jun Han.)

178
00:08:15,428 --> 00:08:18,727
(As soon as I saw Jin Wu's face, I thought he was very handsome.)

179
00:08:18,728 --> 00:08:20,228
(So he caught my eyes.)

180
00:08:20,458 --> 00:08:22,798
He was so handsome that I couldn't look at him.

181
00:08:24,198 --> 00:08:25,397
The weather is nice today.

182
00:08:25,398 --> 00:08:28,068
(But Jin Young chose Jun Han.)

183
00:08:28,208 --> 00:08:29,508
(Holding gently)

184
00:08:31,178 --> 00:08:34,378
(And Jin Wu was unaware of Jin Young's conflict.)

185
00:08:34,508 --> 00:08:36,648
You didn't even look to my side.

186
00:08:37,848 --> 00:08:40,218
Even if I had chosen you then,

187
00:08:40,818 --> 00:08:42,818
we might not have had...

188
00:08:43,318 --> 00:08:45,558
a fun conversation like this...

189
00:08:45,658 --> 00:08:48,728
because your head was occupied by someone else.

190
00:08:51,528 --> 00:08:54,097
It all is what ifs, but if that had happened,

191
00:08:54,098 --> 00:08:56,698
things would've become a whole lot more complicated.

192
00:08:58,698 --> 00:09:02,268
- Now...
- I can't imagine.

193
00:09:03,138 --> 00:09:05,738
It would've been more difficult emotionally...

194
00:09:06,478 --> 00:09:07,578
than the past four days.

195
00:09:08,278 --> 00:09:09,977
Things have already been very difficult for me as they were.

196
00:09:09,978 --> 00:09:12,418
That's why I said that yesterday. When you...

197
00:09:13,778 --> 00:09:15,747
It really broke my heart when you asked...

198
00:09:15,748 --> 00:09:17,758
why I'd treat you so nicely.

199
00:09:19,788 --> 00:09:23,587
There's no reason to treating someone well and reciprocating it.

200
00:09:23,588 --> 00:09:25,327
I treated you well because I wanted to,

201
00:09:25,328 --> 00:09:28,028
and because you deserve to be well-treated.

202
00:09:32,468 --> 00:09:34,837
It's been so long since I've heard something like that,

203
00:09:34,838 --> 00:09:37,008
so I felt so bad for you.

204
00:09:40,808 --> 00:09:41,848
That's why I said...

205
00:09:42,148 --> 00:09:44,418
I did see myself in you.

206
00:09:52,718 --> 00:09:54,788
Watching how Jin Young suffered,

207
00:09:56,488 --> 00:09:59,097
I didn't want her to waste her time...

208
00:09:59,098 --> 00:10:00,858
wallowing in negative emotions.

209
00:10:01,598 --> 00:10:03,268
She broke down in front of me.

210
00:10:08,538 --> 00:10:10,238
And I know how hard it is.

211
00:10:10,938 --> 00:10:12,678
So I didn't want her to cry.

212
00:10:14,748 --> 00:10:19,418
(He saw how he himself suffered in Jin Young, whom he likes.)

213
00:10:20,578 --> 00:10:22,988
I just wanted to take care of you.

214
00:10:24,218 --> 00:10:25,588
I didn't want you to cry.

215
00:10:29,458 --> 00:10:31,797
You cried so sadly in front of me,

216
00:10:31,798 --> 00:10:33,157
and it would've been impossible for me to smile...

217
00:10:33,158 --> 00:10:34,798
or stay nonchalant at that.

218
00:10:39,898 --> 00:10:42,137
I'm sorry about that too.

219
00:10:42,138 --> 00:10:46,137
Anyway, you've said you had feelings for me,

220
00:10:46,138 --> 00:10:48,247
but I cried in front of you...

221
00:10:48,248 --> 00:10:49,878
because I liked another guy.

222
00:10:50,078 --> 00:10:52,978
- That doesn't hurt me at all.
- That was terrible of me.

223
00:10:53,118 --> 00:10:56,687
At that moment, I just wanted to take care of you.

224
00:10:56,688 --> 00:11:00,288
I wanted to become someone who you could rely on at that time.

225
00:11:00,658 --> 00:11:01,858
That was enough then.

226
00:11:05,028 --> 00:11:06,758
I've been telling you...

227
00:11:06,858 --> 00:11:08,227
that it was random...

228
00:11:08,228 --> 00:11:09,897
and that I couldn't understand...

229
00:11:09,898 --> 00:11:12,168
you were being so nice to me...

230
00:11:12,398 --> 00:11:13,898
all of a sudden.

231
00:11:14,368 --> 00:11:16,407
Your affection for me...

232
00:11:16,408 --> 00:11:17,838
felt so fake.

233
00:11:18,778 --> 00:11:21,508
When you were treating me well,

234
00:11:21,608 --> 00:11:23,747
it felt like too much.

235
00:11:23,748 --> 00:11:24,878
Right.

236
00:11:25,418 --> 00:11:26,677
But...

237
00:11:26,678 --> 00:11:30,118
we talked for a long time yesterday.

238
00:11:31,388 --> 00:11:33,018
And you were consistent.

239
00:11:33,358 --> 00:11:34,827
That's when I realized...

240
00:11:34,828 --> 00:11:37,957
you were the sincerest participant...

241
00:11:37,958 --> 00:11:40,497
among everyone here.

242
00:11:40,498 --> 00:11:42,928
(You were the sincerest person here.)

243
00:11:43,168 --> 00:11:44,638
That's when I realized that.

244
00:11:45,268 --> 00:11:46,938
That you were genuine about this.

245
00:11:48,068 --> 00:11:49,338
That I was mistaken.

246
00:11:52,108 --> 00:11:54,308
What if they become a couple after this?

247
00:11:55,208 --> 00:11:59,347
Love doesn't always begin with romantic attraction.

248
00:11:59,348 --> 00:12:02,188
It can also start when two people...

249
00:12:02,588 --> 00:12:05,418
comfort and rely on each other...

250
00:12:05,758 --> 00:12:08,727
through shared pain and wounds.

251
00:12:08,728 --> 00:12:09,958
- Indeed.
- Yes.

252
00:12:10,728 --> 00:12:13,898
(Pondering)

253
00:12:14,158 --> 00:12:17,968
Do you think you can see me again after all this?

254
00:12:18,898 --> 00:12:20,068
You?

255
00:12:27,138 --> 00:12:30,908
(She can't seem to answer.)

256
00:12:32,048 --> 00:12:33,177
As a man?

257
00:12:33,178 --> 00:12:34,248
Obviously.

258
00:12:39,058 --> 00:12:40,588
To be honest,

259
00:12:42,358 --> 00:12:43,628
I...

260
00:12:44,528 --> 00:12:48,568
have been into Jeong Won for too long.

261
00:12:49,568 --> 00:12:51,138
Just because...

262
00:12:51,598 --> 00:12:53,698
I was rejected yesterday.

263
00:12:53,898 --> 00:12:57,908
I don't think I can change my mind overnight.

264
00:13:01,778 --> 00:13:04,277
So, you're not sure who you're going to choose...

265
00:13:04,278 --> 00:13:06,278
in the final decision yet?

266
00:13:07,548 --> 00:13:09,387
I'm torn.

267
00:13:09,388 --> 00:13:11,358
I'm torn, yes.

268
00:13:12,288 --> 00:13:15,458
I can't say for sure that I'll choose you...

269
00:13:15,588 --> 00:13:17,688
or Jeong Won.

270
00:13:17,958 --> 00:13:21,828
I think it depends on what my criteria are...

271
00:13:22,598 --> 00:13:23,768
for the final decision.

272
00:13:24,898 --> 00:13:26,767
She didn't leave him any room yesterday,

273
00:13:26,768 --> 00:13:29,108
but she can't decide today.

274
00:13:29,408 --> 00:13:32,377
I already told you what my criteria would be.

275
00:13:32,378 --> 00:13:35,208
It's not just about the eight days in this program.

276
00:13:36,278 --> 00:13:39,718
I'm considering my everyday life and future outside of this.

277
00:13:39,778 --> 00:13:41,818
My decision will be based on that.

278
00:13:42,918 --> 00:13:46,758
(Jin Young has a lot on her mind before the final decision.)

279
00:13:46,818 --> 00:13:48,388
But my only wish is...

280
00:13:49,558 --> 00:13:51,298
that no other man...

281
00:13:52,998 --> 00:13:54,667
will be involved in your decision.

282
00:13:54,668 --> 00:13:56,698
I hope that you'll pick me...

283
00:13:56,898 --> 00:13:58,767
solely because I'm the first person...

284
00:13:58,768 --> 00:14:00,038
you want to see...

285
00:14:00,438 --> 00:14:01,608
when we leave.

286
00:14:02,568 --> 00:14:04,738
If you're going to pick me, I mean.

287
00:14:05,938 --> 00:14:10,048
(She has a mysterious look on her face.)

288
00:14:10,678 --> 00:14:14,748
(Will his final sincere words change her mind?)

289
00:14:16,188 --> 00:14:18,557
(Meanwhile, another man is waiting for an older woman.)

290
00:14:18,558 --> 00:14:22,528
(Si Won)

291
00:14:28,228 --> 00:14:32,767
(Grinning)

292
00:14:32,768 --> 00:14:34,608
- Hi.
- Hi.

293
00:14:35,638 --> 00:14:37,877
Your outfit looks different today.

294
00:14:37,878 --> 00:14:39,438
- That's right. Yes.
- Right?

295
00:14:42,348 --> 00:14:43,578
Did you wait long?

296
00:14:44,648 --> 00:14:45,817
Not really.

297
00:14:45,818 --> 00:14:46,877
- Really?
- Yes.

298
00:14:46,878 --> 00:14:48,618
Short enough to drink this much coffee.

299
00:14:49,418 --> 00:14:51,288
You didn't have to wait that long, then.

300
00:14:53,088 --> 00:14:55,027
- It's the last day.
- I know.

301
00:14:55,028 --> 00:14:57,998
Doesn't the weather feel like it's the last day?

302
00:14:58,828 --> 00:15:01,228
It feels like the day of the final decision.

303
00:15:01,298 --> 00:15:02,798
- Do you feel serious?
- I do.

304
00:15:04,068 --> 00:15:05,567
It's been so sunny until yesterday.

305
00:15:05,568 --> 00:15:06,768
- I know.
- Right?

306
00:15:11,938 --> 00:15:13,908
(Hesitating)

307
00:15:14,238 --> 00:15:15,908
So, did you make up your mind?

308
00:15:17,048 --> 00:15:18,177
Of course.

309
00:15:18,178 --> 00:15:19,877
- Really?
- Yes.

310
00:15:19,878 --> 00:15:21,647
I thought you were going somewhere else before this.

311
00:15:21,648 --> 00:15:23,088
- Really?
- Yes.

312
00:15:24,248 --> 00:15:26,388
- No one would ask me out, though.
- Really?

313
00:15:26,758 --> 00:15:28,758
There's no one else.

314
00:15:30,958 --> 00:15:33,528
How do you think you'll feel after this?

315
00:15:35,828 --> 00:15:37,198
After this...

316
00:15:39,638 --> 00:15:41,097
- I'll probably be busy.
- A busy life.

317
00:15:41,098 --> 00:15:42,668
- Yes, a busy life.
- Yes.

318
00:15:43,138 --> 00:15:45,177
I do wonder what we'll turn out to be.

319
00:15:45,178 --> 00:15:46,808
- So do I.
- Right?

320
00:15:47,078 --> 00:15:50,208
- It's such an unusual situation.
- Right.

321
00:15:52,518 --> 00:15:54,177
I think it'll be...

322
00:15:54,178 --> 00:15:56,047
- more awkward outside.
- Right.

323
00:15:56,048 --> 00:15:57,447
- When we suddenly meet.
- When we suddenly meet.

324
00:15:57,448 --> 00:15:58,517
It'll be awkward at first.

325
00:15:58,518 --> 00:16:00,358
- The moment we meet.
- Yes.

326
00:16:00,688 --> 00:16:02,928
Both our ears might turn red.

327
00:16:03,458 --> 00:16:05,598
- This whole area will turn red.
- Exactly.

328
00:16:06,558 --> 00:16:07,858
I think so.

329
00:16:08,128 --> 00:16:09,328
So,

330
00:16:09,598 --> 00:16:11,938
I kind of...

331
00:16:12,538 --> 00:16:14,038
want to go...

332
00:16:14,868 --> 00:16:17,737
- on a date outside.
- So do I.

333
00:16:17,738 --> 00:16:18,837
I wonder how it feels.

334
00:16:18,838 --> 00:16:19,877
- Same here.
- Yes.

335
00:16:19,878 --> 00:16:21,078
Without all the cameras.

336
00:16:21,508 --> 00:16:23,508
- I think it'll be fun.
- I think so too.

337
00:16:23,648 --> 00:16:26,248
It'll probably feel real...

338
00:16:26,648 --> 00:16:28,317
- at that moment.
- Yes, it'll hit us.

339
00:16:28,318 --> 00:16:29,418
I agree.

340
00:16:31,588 --> 00:16:33,888
- I had a question for you.
- Okay.

341
00:16:34,858 --> 00:16:36,558
Do you plan on getting married?

342
00:16:37,358 --> 00:16:38,728
Do you plan on getting married?

343
00:16:38,858 --> 00:16:40,357
(Flustered)

344
00:16:40,358 --> 00:16:42,227
- I think it's like this.
- Okay.

345
00:16:42,228 --> 00:16:43,568
I can't say...

346
00:16:43,598 --> 00:16:45,598
that I'm totally...

347
00:16:47,068 --> 00:16:49,337
- against marriage.
- Okay.

348
00:16:49,338 --> 00:16:52,007
But I may not get married if I don't find anyone...

349
00:16:52,008 --> 00:16:53,778
I want to marry.

350
00:16:54,078 --> 00:16:56,307
But my basic idea is...

351
00:16:56,308 --> 00:16:58,018
that I want to get married someday.

352
00:16:58,418 --> 00:17:00,848
- But right now...
- If you find someone to marry?

353
00:17:01,248 --> 00:17:02,688
But I'm not talking...

354
00:17:02,918 --> 00:17:04,757
about this year or next year.

355
00:17:04,758 --> 00:17:06,457
When I find someone I love...

356
00:17:06,458 --> 00:17:08,227
and our timing is right,

357
00:17:08,228 --> 00:17:10,588
I want to get married. That's my idea.

358
00:17:10,958 --> 00:17:13,457
So, it's more about the person than time.

359
00:17:13,458 --> 00:17:14,944
(It's more about the person than time.)

360
00:17:14,968 --> 00:17:16,868
- What about you? Say...
- Yes?

361
00:17:17,028 --> 00:17:19,697
We end up dating outside of this.

362
00:17:19,698 --> 00:17:22,508
And I said to you, "I want to get married next year."

363
00:17:22,608 --> 00:17:23,637
Next year?

364
00:17:23,638 --> 00:17:26,208
You'll be 26 then. How do you think you'll feel?

365
00:17:26,278 --> 00:17:27,538
- I'll be 26?
- Yes.

366
00:17:29,448 --> 00:17:32,948
I don't know what kind of person I'll be in a year,

367
00:17:35,748 --> 00:17:37,987
but when I'm 26...

368
00:17:37,988 --> 00:17:40,218
Well, it's not that I care about my age.

369
00:17:40,988 --> 00:17:43,957
But it's likely that I won't be prepared enough.

370
00:17:43,958 --> 00:17:46,097
- Realistically speaking.
- Right.

371
00:17:46,098 --> 00:17:47,557
But once I'm ready,

372
00:17:47,558 --> 00:17:48,928
I want to get married...

373
00:17:48,998 --> 00:17:51,368
regardless of my age.

374
00:17:51,938 --> 00:17:54,498
When I'm with you,

375
00:17:54,908 --> 00:17:56,067
the age...

376
00:17:56,068 --> 00:17:58,277
(The age difference)

377
00:17:58,278 --> 00:17:59,377
doesn't really hit me.

378
00:17:59,378 --> 00:18:01,947
I'm not even certain if you're really 25.

379
00:18:01,948 --> 00:18:03,447
It just feels like you're my age.

380
00:18:03,448 --> 00:18:05,347
- You're more up to date than I am.
- I know!

381
00:18:05,348 --> 00:18:07,447
- I feel younger.
- Exactly.

382
00:18:07,448 --> 00:18:09,024
(A guy born in 2002 who knows nothing about Gen Z)

383
00:18:09,048 --> 00:18:12,288
But when I picture it,

384
00:18:13,258 --> 00:18:14,488
I realize...

385
00:18:15,958 --> 00:18:20,058
that it won't be easy.

386
00:18:20,598 --> 00:18:22,927
- Naturally.
- Yes.

387
00:18:22,928 --> 00:18:24,967
And you've never dated anyone younger than you.

388
00:18:24,968 --> 00:18:25,998
Never.

389
00:18:26,168 --> 00:18:29,168
And a guy who's 12 years younger popped out...

390
00:18:29,768 --> 00:18:32,207
and started making a move on you.

391
00:18:32,208 --> 00:18:34,477
- He literally popped out.
- Exactly.

392
00:18:34,478 --> 00:18:36,748
Why did you have to be 25?

393
00:18:36,948 --> 00:18:38,248
Why?

394
00:18:39,418 --> 00:18:41,548
I think it's natural that you're worried.

395
00:18:42,348 --> 00:18:44,818
But when I'm with you,

396
00:18:45,118 --> 00:18:46,387
I forget about the age gap.

397
00:18:46,388 --> 00:18:48,387
I also think this works because of that.

398
00:18:48,388 --> 00:18:49,458
- Right?
- Yes.

399
00:18:49,658 --> 00:18:52,927
If I noticed the age difference when I was with you,

400
00:18:52,928 --> 00:18:55,628
I'd be worried that it might not work.

401
00:18:56,168 --> 00:18:58,368
- But I didn't sense any of that.
- Right.

402
00:18:59,098 --> 00:19:00,738
So, I...

403
00:19:00,998 --> 00:19:02,408
want to see you...

404
00:19:03,238 --> 00:19:04,307
- Outside of this?
- Yes.

405
00:19:04,308 --> 00:19:05,578
- I'd like to.
- Me too.

406
00:19:06,278 --> 00:19:08,358
- We have to try grilled hagfish.
- Grilled hagfish.

407
00:19:08,508 --> 00:19:10,248
I should pay for that.

408
00:19:11,748 --> 00:19:13,277
I'm a big eater.

409
00:19:13,278 --> 00:19:14,347
(Yu Jin and Si Won finished their last talk...)

410
00:19:14,348 --> 00:19:15,587
So am I.

411
00:19:15,588 --> 00:19:17,717
Would you be okay spending 1,000 dollars there?

412
00:19:17,718 --> 00:19:18,838
(before the final decision.)

413
00:19:18,888 --> 00:19:22,228
(What's going on at Yeon House?)

414
00:19:22,588 --> 00:19:26,558
(Ju Hee and Ji Hye are sitting in the vanity room together.)

415
00:19:27,658 --> 00:19:28,767
(Sighing)

416
00:19:28,768 --> 00:19:30,768
No!

417
00:19:31,068 --> 00:19:32,568
Why are you sighing again?

418
00:19:33,668 --> 00:19:35,737
Last night was fatal.

419
00:19:35,738 --> 00:19:37,308
It was Yun So's fault.

420
00:19:37,468 --> 00:19:40,278
But when it comes to dating a younger guy,

421
00:19:40,338 --> 00:19:41,437
that's part of the fun.

422
00:19:41,438 --> 00:19:42,877
He makes a slip of the tongue,

423
00:19:42,878 --> 00:19:44,107
so you scold him, spank him,

424
00:19:44,108 --> 00:19:45,248
and correct him.

425
00:19:45,748 --> 00:19:46,817
He makes another mistake,

426
00:19:46,818 --> 00:19:47,818
you glare at him,

427
00:19:47,819 --> 00:19:49,748
and he goes, "I'm sorry." It goes like this.

428
00:19:53,158 --> 00:19:56,858
(Ju Hee has a lot on her mind and steps out.)

429
00:19:58,428 --> 00:19:59,757
She's going to educate him.

430
00:19:59,758 --> 00:20:02,068
(Where is she headed?)

431
00:20:02,998 --> 00:20:04,168
Yun So!

432
00:20:05,398 --> 00:20:06,498
She's here.

433
00:20:07,768 --> 00:20:09,308
- Ju Hee, I'm here.
- Hey.

434
00:20:10,068 --> 00:20:11,368
I thought you were in this room.

435
00:20:12,108 --> 00:20:13,237
(They came into a room for a chat.)

436
00:20:13,238 --> 00:20:14,884
- You can sit there.
- Please make up with him.

437
00:20:14,908 --> 00:20:16,008
Okay.

438
00:20:23,488 --> 00:20:25,118
Now that we're leaving,

439
00:20:25,518 --> 00:20:27,688
we start thinking about reality.

440
00:20:27,758 --> 00:20:28,828
Right.

441
00:20:29,528 --> 00:20:32,328
That's true. I understand.

442
00:20:32,458 --> 00:20:33,698
Was age a big factor?

443
00:20:36,428 --> 00:20:38,337
No, I just...

444
00:20:38,338 --> 00:20:41,267
casually asked you...

445
00:20:41,268 --> 00:20:42,467
about the future plans,

446
00:20:42,468 --> 00:20:45,978
and it looked like it was too much pressure for you.

447
00:20:46,108 --> 00:20:49,407
That means you were already feeling some type of pressure.

448
00:20:49,408 --> 00:20:52,047
Once I felt that...

449
00:20:52,048 --> 00:20:53,624
(She strongly felt that he was pressured.)

450
00:20:53,648 --> 00:20:56,187
I thought, "What can we do after this?"

451
00:20:56,188 --> 00:20:57,588
"Just be boyfriend and girlfriend?"

452
00:20:58,358 --> 00:21:02,258
If you feel such pressure from the beginning,

453
00:21:02,588 --> 00:21:05,398
I don't see any possibilities that this will work.

454
00:21:06,728 --> 00:21:09,867
I wasn't exactly burdened, though.

455
00:21:09,868 --> 00:21:12,797
I just didn't expect to discuss that with you that day.

456
00:21:12,798 --> 00:21:14,637
I thought we had to...

457
00:21:14,638 --> 00:21:16,168
get familiar first.

458
00:21:16,668 --> 00:21:19,738
We had already expressed our interests,

459
00:21:19,938 --> 00:21:23,048
but we didn't have enough time to talk after that.

460
00:21:23,948 --> 00:21:26,278
That day, I thought it was...

461
00:21:26,948 --> 00:21:31,188
our chance to get closer,

462
00:21:31,518 --> 00:21:33,598
and you said you wanted to talk about serious stuff.

463
00:21:34,718 --> 00:21:37,958
I was like, "Serious stuff? That's pretty sudden."

464
00:21:38,328 --> 00:21:40,374
I didn't feel any pressure. I was just caught off guard.

465
00:21:40,398 --> 00:21:43,098
So, I thought about it, and my mind went blank.

466
00:21:43,898 --> 00:21:46,498
That can also be educated.

467
00:21:46,768 --> 00:21:48,968
He hasn't been educated yet.

468
00:21:49,008 --> 00:21:50,337
Because he's too young.

469
00:21:50,338 --> 00:21:52,307
He's lived 11 years shorter than Ju Hee, so...

470
00:21:52,308 --> 00:21:53,607
- Exactly.
- Right.

471
00:21:53,608 --> 00:21:55,277
- He's not educated yet.
- Right.

472
00:21:55,278 --> 00:21:56,308
That's so true.

473
00:21:57,708 --> 00:21:59,778
I had taken our relationship seriously,

474
00:22:00,018 --> 00:22:02,847
but once I moved past it and thought about marriage,

475
00:22:02,848 --> 00:22:04,087
my mind went blank.

476
00:22:04,088 --> 00:22:05,718
- Exactly.
- It's natural for him.

477
00:22:06,188 --> 00:22:08,087
But I'm old enough to consider that matter.

478
00:22:08,088 --> 00:22:09,088
You're right.

479
00:22:09,258 --> 00:22:12,997
That's when I started thinking...

480
00:22:12,998 --> 00:22:15,297
- that we wouldn't work.
- Right.

481
00:22:15,298 --> 00:22:16,828
You're right. I understand.

482
00:22:17,168 --> 00:22:19,198
But it's true that you had...

483
00:22:20,238 --> 00:22:21,867
feelings for me...

484
00:22:21,868 --> 00:22:24,468
- when we talked in the Talk Room.
- Yes.

485
00:22:24,608 --> 00:22:28,308
I should be choosing someone I want to keep seeing...

486
00:22:29,578 --> 00:22:31,108
when this ends.

487
00:22:31,678 --> 00:22:33,318
But if you're flustered by that question,

488
00:22:33,418 --> 00:22:36,148
how are we supposed to make progress?

489
00:22:38,358 --> 00:22:39,788
That's the trickiest issue.

490
00:22:40,658 --> 00:22:43,588
Anyway, even after all those conversations,

491
00:22:44,528 --> 00:22:46,528
it wasn't enough to convince me.

492
00:22:47,258 --> 00:22:51,228
So, you don't think our feelings can grow deeper,

493
00:22:51,368 --> 00:22:54,768
and you don't want to picture our future together?

494
00:22:59,738 --> 00:23:01,738
It didn't look like you were picturing our future.

495
00:23:03,778 --> 00:23:06,918
But we could start doing that together.

496
00:23:08,118 --> 00:23:10,088
But we didn't talk about that.

497
00:23:10,248 --> 00:23:11,318
Okay.

498
00:23:12,788 --> 00:23:14,788
I could tell that you were flustered.

499
00:23:16,928 --> 00:23:20,398
That's true. I was flustered.

500
00:23:20,558 --> 00:23:22,638
I didn't expect you to bring that up at that moment.

501
00:23:24,098 --> 00:23:25,368
But I wanted...

502
00:23:25,568 --> 00:23:29,138
our relationship to get more serious.

503
00:23:29,538 --> 00:23:31,038
I never took it lightly.

504
00:23:31,708 --> 00:23:34,178
So, I wanted to picture it together through conversations.

505
00:23:37,148 --> 00:23:39,318
- Why is it so complicated?
- Us?

506
00:23:39,418 --> 00:23:41,018
Why am I...

507
00:23:41,678 --> 00:23:42,848
- Yourself?
- Yes.

508
00:23:44,418 --> 00:23:46,118
All my emotions are tangled up.

509
00:23:47,858 --> 00:23:50,888
He should say something to convince her right now.

510
00:23:50,958 --> 00:23:52,557
I know I'm not good enough.

511
00:23:52,558 --> 00:23:56,328
(I know I'm not good enough.)

512
00:23:59,498 --> 00:24:01,497
But I also have a job, you know?

513
00:24:01,498 --> 00:24:04,067
(Yun So)

514
00:24:04,068 --> 00:24:05,208
I also have a job.

515
00:24:05,638 --> 00:24:06,837
You do.

516
00:24:06,838 --> 00:24:08,078
And if things go well with you,

517
00:24:09,648 --> 00:24:11,548
who knows what will happen to us?

518
00:24:13,078 --> 00:24:14,754
I'm confident that I can make you happy...

519
00:24:14,778 --> 00:24:16,118
and that I can treat you right.

520
00:24:19,088 --> 00:24:20,658
I want you to believe me.

521
00:24:21,588 --> 00:24:24,528
I'm not a shallow person, but you don't take me seriously.

522
00:24:26,458 --> 00:24:27,728
I do take you seriously.

523
00:24:29,528 --> 00:24:30,827
She's feeling better.

524
00:24:30,828 --> 00:24:32,498
- She feels better!
- A little bit.

525
00:24:33,138 --> 00:24:34,468
I do take you seriously.

526
00:24:37,768 --> 00:24:39,738
(Frustrated)

527
00:24:44,778 --> 00:24:46,918
Relationships are tricky.

528
00:24:48,278 --> 00:24:50,518
Anyway, I want you to know...

529
00:24:50,588 --> 00:24:51,988
that I take us seriously...

530
00:24:53,658 --> 00:24:55,158
and that I care about you.

531
00:24:56,888 --> 00:24:59,327
We can always picture...

532
00:24:59,328 --> 00:25:01,227
our future together.

533
00:25:01,228 --> 00:25:03,628
Yes! He knows what to say.

