1053
00:50:55,999 --> 00:50:57,398
As for me, I don't have much concern...

1054
00:50:57,399 --> 00:50:59,838
- about the age difference.
- That's right. Me neither.

1055
00:50:59,839 --> 00:51:01,639
But what worries me is this.

1056
00:51:02,199 --> 00:51:05,339
Usually, when a younger man and an older woman see each other,

1057
00:51:05,739 --> 00:51:08,108
one could have more experience...

1058
00:51:08,109 --> 00:51:10,048
while the other doesn't.

1059
00:51:10,049 --> 00:51:12,249
- That's true.
- Also, the difference...

1060
00:51:12,549 --> 00:51:15,118
- in one's financial sense...
- Okay.

1061
00:51:15,119 --> 00:51:17,419
- cannot be ignored.
- Right.

1062
00:51:17,849 --> 00:51:18,919
But...

1063
00:51:19,959 --> 00:51:21,158
don't worry about me.

1064
00:51:21,159 --> 00:51:23,958
(But don't worry about me.)

1065
00:51:23,959 --> 00:51:25,889
I just think...

1066
00:51:27,929 --> 00:51:29,468
I didn't get to show you...

1067
00:51:29,469 --> 00:51:30,828
(I haven't shown you 100 percent of myself.)

1068
00:51:30,829 --> 00:51:32,499
all of me.

1069
00:51:33,639 --> 00:51:37,439
I believe you'll find many aspects of me charming.

1070
00:51:38,639 --> 00:51:39,999
I'm just selling myself once more.

1071
00:51:40,039 --> 00:51:41,679
- No need to consider him young.
- Right.

1072
00:51:42,079 --> 00:51:44,909
(Word of assurance for Ji Hye who feels anxious)

1073
00:51:45,949 --> 00:51:47,549
- You have no regrets, right?
- Right.

1074
00:51:47,679 --> 00:51:50,319
If you regret it, tell me now and run.

1075
00:51:52,419 --> 00:51:54,089
- No, I have no regrets.
- Okay.

1076
00:51:56,989 --> 00:52:00,958
(Will Ji Hye keep the promise?)

1077
00:52:00,959 --> 00:52:02,399
What will you do, Ji Hye?

1078
00:52:02,829 --> 00:52:04,199
I think she'll show up.

1079
00:52:04,699 --> 00:52:06,069
I hope she does.

1080
00:52:07,339 --> 00:52:09,569
(Nervous)

1081
00:52:11,609 --> 00:52:13,038
(Turning)

1082
00:52:13,039 --> 00:52:14,039
(Beaming)

1083
00:52:14,040 --> 00:52:15,079
You're here.

1084
00:52:16,609 --> 00:52:18,549
(Smiling)

1085
00:52:20,019 --> 00:52:21,079
You're here.

1086
00:52:21,349 --> 00:52:22,419
Gosh.

1087
00:52:22,479 --> 00:52:23,488
She's here.

1088
00:52:23,489 --> 00:52:24,969
- They met after a week.
- Seriously?

1089
00:52:25,289 --> 00:52:26,558
They must be so happy to see each other...

1090
00:52:26,559 --> 00:52:28,758
since it's been a week.

1091
00:52:28,759 --> 00:52:31,389
Hug. Hug each other already!

1092
00:52:32,529 --> 00:52:33,828
- How have you been?
- How have you been?

1093
00:52:33,829 --> 00:52:36,329
Good. How have you been, Ji Hye?

1094
00:52:36,869 --> 00:52:38,729
- Good.
- I brought you a gift.

1095
00:52:39,169 --> 00:52:40,299
- What is it?
- A perfume.

1096
00:52:40,669 --> 00:52:41,838
- Is it for me?
- Yes.

1097
00:52:41,839 --> 00:52:42,939
- Really?
- Yes.

1098
00:52:43,039 --> 00:52:44,109
I loved its scent.

1099
00:52:44,139 --> 00:52:46,109
- Really?
- Yes. So I bought it.

1100
00:52:46,809 --> 00:52:48,278
Nice start, Jeong Won.

1101
00:52:48,279 --> 00:52:49,279
(Happy)

1102
00:52:49,280 --> 00:52:50,308
- Let's hold hands.
- Let's go somewhere quiet.

1103
00:52:50,309 --> 00:52:51,478
- Hold hands? Okay.
- Yes.

1104
00:52:51,479 --> 00:52:53,048
Let's show it to the world.

1105
00:52:53,049 --> 00:52:54,049
(Holding tightly)

1106
00:52:54,050 --> 00:52:55,148
I'll hold this for you.

1107
00:52:55,149 --> 00:52:56,348
These flowers are pretty.

1108
00:52:56,349 --> 00:52:58,049
- Right? They're pretty.
- Yes, they are.

1109
00:52:58,819 --> 00:53:01,018
I didn't know you were a man who could prepare such a thing.

1110
00:53:01,019 --> 00:53:02,059
Of course, I am.

1111
00:53:04,389 --> 00:53:05,758
Have you given it much thought?

1112
00:53:05,759 --> 00:53:07,729
Have you thought it through before you come here?

1113
00:53:08,429 --> 00:53:09,469
Yes.

1114
00:53:10,269 --> 00:53:13,139
When I look back at my life,

1115
00:53:13,599 --> 00:53:16,738
I was a workaholic, addicted to work.

1116
00:53:16,739 --> 00:53:17,739
- Right?
- Yes.

1117
00:53:17,740 --> 00:53:18,969
Maybe...

1118
00:53:20,279 --> 00:53:21,609
while working,

1119
00:53:21,879 --> 00:53:24,848
I might get burned out in the future.

1120
00:53:24,849 --> 00:53:26,049
Right.

1121
00:53:26,849 --> 00:53:28,719
And when I have concerns about my life,

1122
00:53:29,789 --> 00:53:31,949
I thought you'd hear them out.

1123
00:53:32,419 --> 00:53:34,689
And you'd share it with me.

1124
00:53:35,059 --> 00:53:36,288
- Did you think so?
- Yes.

1125
00:53:36,289 --> 00:53:37,729
That's the best.

1126
00:53:37,959 --> 00:53:39,629
- Do you think I'll be helpful?
- Yes.

1127
00:53:39,759 --> 00:53:41,635
I had a strong feeling you'd help me in that situation.

1128
00:53:41,659 --> 00:53:42,759
- Really?
- Yes.

1129
00:53:42,869 --> 00:53:44,169
Maybe...

1130
00:53:45,029 --> 00:53:48,469
my ideal type isn't someone I do business with.

1131
00:53:48,869 --> 00:53:53,378
Maybe it's someone who I can have fun living life with.

1132
00:53:53,379 --> 00:53:55,478
- Maybe that's my ideal type.
- I see.

1133
00:53:55,479 --> 00:53:58,049
- That was what I was thinking.
- My goodness.

1134
00:53:58,209 --> 00:53:59,348
What about you?

1135
00:53:59,349 --> 00:54:01,649
Actually, I had more concerns than you did.

1136
00:54:01,949 --> 00:54:05,118
I'm at a point in my life where I have to think realistically.

1137
00:54:05,119 --> 00:54:06,189
That's true.

1138
00:54:06,289 --> 00:54:09,629
Right now, we don't think about getting married.

1139
00:54:09,989 --> 00:54:11,458
But after seeing you a couple of years,

1140
00:54:11,459 --> 00:54:13,629
- I might think differently.
- Right.

1141
00:54:13,759 --> 00:54:17,628
If our opinions differ at that point,

1142
00:54:17,629 --> 00:54:18,699
it's...

1143
00:54:19,369 --> 00:54:22,238
Realistically, we'll have to break up.

1144
00:54:22,239 --> 00:54:23,269
That's right.

1145
00:54:23,339 --> 00:54:25,538
I'm at an age where I should start thinking about marriage.

1146
00:54:25,539 --> 00:54:26,539
That's right.

1147
00:54:27,279 --> 00:54:29,208
What if I regret myself...

1148
00:54:29,209 --> 00:54:31,949
after 2 or 3 years for making this choice?

1149
00:54:32,949 --> 00:54:34,179
I think...

1150
00:54:34,979 --> 00:54:37,649
I know what you worry about.

1151
00:54:37,949 --> 00:54:39,959
- What I...
- Right.

1152
00:54:41,289 --> 00:54:43,159
What I can say for sure is...

1153
00:54:43,829 --> 00:54:46,729
that I'll behave, so you won't worry too much about it.

1154
00:54:47,929 --> 00:54:50,199
- I'll make you feel secure.
- Okay.

1155
00:54:50,969 --> 00:54:52,199
This is amazing.

1156
00:54:52,329 --> 00:54:54,068
Okay. Let's see what will happen in two years.

1157
00:54:54,069 --> 00:54:55,599
I'll see if you'll say the same thing.

1158
00:54:57,809 --> 00:54:59,409
I just said it openly here.

1159
00:55:01,309 --> 00:55:02,809
- Good.
- Good.

1160
00:55:03,309 --> 00:55:05,009
Just like in the Yeon House,

1161
00:55:05,449 --> 00:55:07,419
let's keep that chemistry going.

1162
00:55:07,719 --> 00:55:09,919
- Okay.
- They look good with each other.

1163
00:55:09,989 --> 00:55:11,289
- They're cute.
- Shall we?

1164
00:55:12,749 --> 00:55:13,759
Let's go.

1165
00:55:14,159 --> 00:55:15,718
- I'm happy for them.
- Crazy.

1166
00:55:15,719 --> 00:55:17,558
I'm so happy. Congratulations.

1167
00:55:17,559 --> 00:55:18,559
What should we eat?

1168
00:55:18,560 --> 00:55:19,758
- Let's eat something tasty.
- Okay.

1169
00:55:19,759 --> 00:55:21,259
Go get the grilled hagfish.

1170
00:55:21,899 --> 00:55:23,529
I want to take photobooth photos.

1171
00:55:23,669 --> 00:55:24,999
- Let's do it.
- Okay.

1172
00:55:25,499 --> 00:55:27,268
Since it's come to this,

1173
00:55:27,269 --> 00:55:28,789
why didn't you come in a wedding gown?

1174
00:55:29,039 --> 00:55:30,239
Should I borrow it from her?

1175
00:55:30,639 --> 00:55:32,979
Exactly. You should have worn a wedding gown.

1176
00:55:33,479 --> 00:55:34,709
I was clueless, wasn't I?

1177
00:55:35,039 --> 00:55:36,478
We now have a couple...

1178
00:55:36,479 --> 00:55:38,609
with a six-year age difference.

1179
00:55:41,149 --> 00:55:42,478
(Ju Hee and Yun So agreed to meet...)

1180
00:55:42,479 --> 00:55:43,748
- Ju Hee and Yun So.
- Ju Hee and Yun So.

1181
00:55:43,749 --> 00:55:46,488
(at 2pm in a Hangang Park.)

1182
00:55:46,489 --> 00:55:47,659
Hangang Park.

1183
00:55:50,229 --> 00:55:55,528
(Will they be able to meet while a week has passed?)

1184
00:55:55,529 --> 00:55:56,669
What do you think?

1185
00:55:56,899 --> 00:55:58,669
I think Yun So will show up for sure.

1186
00:55:58,969 --> 00:56:00,198
- But Ju Hee lived...
- I'm concerned.

1187
00:56:00,199 --> 00:56:01,998
In the real world for a week.

1188
00:56:01,999 --> 00:56:03,138
That's a big deal.

1189
00:56:03,139 --> 00:56:04,615
- It must've affected her a lot.
- Yes.

1190
00:56:04,639 --> 00:56:05,639
(Sighing)

1191
00:56:05,640 --> 00:56:07,285
- What will happen?
- I'm a bit concerned.

1192
00:56:07,309 --> 00:56:08,739
I'm a bit worried about Ju Hee.

1193
00:56:11,809 --> 00:56:13,118
(Yun So came to the meeting spot as expected.)

1194
00:56:13,119 --> 00:56:14,618
Yes. I knew he would come.

1195
00:56:14,619 --> 00:56:19,219
(Yun So came to the meeting spot as expected.)

1196
00:56:21,319 --> 00:56:22,389
Actually,

1197
00:56:22,959 --> 00:56:26,459
we had mixed feelings about us until the end.

1198
00:56:27,429 --> 00:56:30,799
I don't think there is an absolute guarantee...

1199
00:56:31,769 --> 00:56:34,999
that we'll meet after seven days.

1200
00:56:38,139 --> 00:56:41,478
(A 24-year-old at the beginning of his career...)

1201
00:56:41,479 --> 00:56:44,649
(and a 35-year-old who thinks about marriage)

1202
00:56:46,209 --> 00:56:50,388
(They were afraid of and worried about...)

1203
00:56:50,389 --> 00:56:52,348
(the realistic problems the faced.)

1204
00:56:52,349 --> 00:56:54,759
They had a rollercoaster ride with many ups and downs.

1205
00:56:55,259 --> 00:56:57,559
(I don't see a future in you.)

1206
00:56:57,959 --> 00:56:59,489
I do have a job.

1207
00:56:59,589 --> 00:57:00,958
(The present was more important for Yun So...)

1208
00:57:00,959 --> 00:57:05,929
(while the future was for Ju Hee.)

1209
00:57:07,799 --> 00:57:10,538
They were so confused even in the Yeon House.

1210
00:57:10,539 --> 00:57:12,669
- They were on a rollercoaster ride.
- Yes.

1211
00:57:13,809 --> 00:57:16,208
(Yun So is standing alone at the meeting point.)

1212
00:57:16,209 --> 00:57:19,009
- Can she come for a meal?
- She's not coming.

1213
00:57:19,249 --> 00:57:20,679
Oh, dear.

1214
00:57:21,449 --> 00:57:25,748
(It's close to their meeting time, but Ju Hee is nowhere to be found.)

1215
00:57:25,749 --> 00:57:27,458
(Looking around)

1216
00:57:27,459 --> 00:57:29,518
She's not coming. Oh, no.

1217
00:57:29,519 --> 00:57:30,989
I think she's not coming.

1218
00:57:32,729 --> 00:57:39,528
(He's more nervous because he knows what Ju Hee worries about.)

1219
00:57:39,529 --> 00:57:41,498
But it's so sad to leave each other like this.

1220
00:57:41,499 --> 00:57:44,038
- No, they have to be matched.
- I know.

1221
00:57:44,039 --> 00:57:45,138
If she wants to end it, she should do it...

1222
00:57:45,139 --> 00:57:47,019
- after seeing each other a bit.
- It can't be.

1223
00:57:52,849 --> 00:57:55,878
(It's past the meeting time, but Ju Hee isn't here.)

1224
00:57:55,879 --> 00:57:56,988
It's over for them.

1225
00:57:56,989 --> 00:57:58,048
- Is it over?
- It's over.

1226
00:57:58,049 --> 00:58:00,159
No. Come on. Seriously.

1227
00:58:00,759 --> 00:58:03,358
(Staring)

1228
00:58:03,359 --> 00:58:04,429
What?

1229
00:58:05,489 --> 00:58:06,558
Is she here?

1230
00:58:06,559 --> 00:58:08,285
(What? Is she here?)

1231
00:58:09,599 --> 00:58:12,238
(Staring)

1232
00:58:12,263 --> 00:58:13,293
What?

1233
00:58:14,393 --> 00:58:15,432
Is she here?

1234
00:58:15,433 --> 00:58:16,793
(What? Is she here?)

1235
00:58:18,133 --> 00:58:19,133
What?

1236
00:58:20,603 --> 00:58:23,232
(Ju Hee shows up at the meeting spot.)

1237
00:58:23,233 --> 00:58:24,672
- Gosh.
- What?

1238
00:58:24,673 --> 00:58:25,703
(For goodness' sake!)

1239
00:58:26,373 --> 00:58:27,642
What is this? Seriously.

1240
00:58:27,643 --> 00:58:29,473
(Totally relieved)

1241
00:58:30,673 --> 00:58:32,513
She looks so pretty.

1242
00:58:32,613 --> 00:58:33,742
Why does she look so pretty?

1243
00:58:33,743 --> 00:58:35,713
She has become even prettier in the meantime.

1244
00:58:35,753 --> 00:58:38,653
(Falling for her for the 100th time)

1245
00:58:40,383 --> 00:58:44,593
(Ju Hee brought flowers just like Yun So.)

1246
00:58:44,953 --> 00:58:46,422
- Did you bring flowers?
- Yes.

1247
00:58:46,423 --> 00:58:47,662
(They're meeting each other after a week.)

1248
00:58:47,663 --> 00:58:49,663
- Mine is smaller.
- I know.

1249
00:58:50,593 --> 00:58:52,463
I asked for a small bouquet, but...

1250
00:58:52,563 --> 00:58:54,003
Exactly. What is this?

1251
00:58:54,163 --> 00:58:55,843
- But...
- It feels like a graduation day.

1252
00:58:56,473 --> 00:58:58,913
- What? They're twinning again.
- They wore matching clothes.

1253
00:59:00,003 --> 00:59:01,972
I should have bought a bigger one.

1254
00:59:01,973 --> 00:59:02,973
(Embarrassed)

1255
00:59:04,443 --> 00:59:05,513
No, it's cute.

1256
00:59:07,543 --> 00:59:08,783
Have you been well?

1257
00:59:08,913 --> 00:59:10,053
How have you been?

1258
00:59:11,883 --> 00:59:14,722
I couldn't focus at work.

1259
00:59:14,723 --> 00:59:17,653
I mean, time was moving slowly.

1260
00:59:18,053 --> 00:59:20,863
Every morning I woke up, I thought of you a lot.

1261
00:59:22,433 --> 00:59:24,433
(Touched)

1262
00:59:24,593 --> 00:59:25,963
I really missed you.

1263
00:59:27,303 --> 00:59:30,732
When I came out, I thought you might not show up.

1264
00:59:30,733 --> 00:59:31,833
Me?

1265
00:59:32,143 --> 00:59:34,943
Why? I was completely into you.

1266
00:59:36,313 --> 00:59:37,343
That wasn't enough?

1267
00:59:38,213 --> 00:59:40,283
It was because I acted so indecisively back then.

1268
00:59:41,913 --> 00:59:45,012
So you might think you can't handle such a person...

1269
00:59:45,013 --> 00:59:46,323
in real life.

1270
00:59:46,753 --> 00:59:48,482
- You're right.
- It's okay to have doubts.

1271
00:59:48,483 --> 00:59:49,693
That's right.

1272
00:59:50,093 --> 00:59:52,053
On the contrary,

1273
00:59:53,193 --> 00:59:55,663
I thought about you so much during the past week.

1274
00:59:56,363 --> 00:59:58,362
I am more certain about my feelings...

1275
00:59:58,363 --> 00:59:59,909
compared to the time when I was in the Yeon House.

1276
00:59:59,933 --> 01:00:01,063
Really?

1277
01:00:01,663 --> 01:00:03,033
I really do like you.

1278
01:00:03,333 --> 01:00:04,603
That was why.

1279
01:00:06,103 --> 01:00:07,243
My mind was made up.

1280
01:00:08,503 --> 01:00:10,143
- Are you being shy?
- Yes.

1281
01:00:10,173 --> 01:00:11,673
What? Is there something over there?

1282
01:00:13,383 --> 01:00:15,183
Give her a hug, Yun So.

1283
01:00:15,283 --> 01:00:16,382
Exactly.

1284
01:00:16,383 --> 01:00:17,929
(Yun So is just happy about this situation.)

1285
01:00:17,953 --> 01:00:19,353
Why are you blushing?

1286
01:00:25,093 --> 01:00:26,123
Shall we take a walk?

1287
01:00:27,663 --> 01:00:29,163
- Let's walk that way.
- Okay.

1288
01:00:31,693 --> 01:00:34,333
(They hold hands without hesitation.)

1289
01:00:34,903 --> 01:00:35,973
I'm so happy to see you.

1290
01:00:37,473 --> 01:00:38,533
Me too.

1291
01:00:41,773 --> 01:00:44,173
So? How is it to see me outside the Yeon House?

1292
01:00:44,473 --> 01:00:45,643
You look even prettier.

1293
01:00:47,683 --> 01:00:49,282
Gosh. I wish they would get married.

1294
01:00:49,283 --> 01:00:51,112
- Seriously.
- Yes.

1295
01:00:51,113 --> 01:00:52,483
After raising Yun So well.

1296
01:00:55,153 --> 01:00:56,923
- This is good.
- What is?

1297
01:00:57,493 --> 01:00:59,592
- It's good to see you outside.
- Right?

1298
01:00:59,593 --> 01:01:01,323
Of course, it's lovely.

1299
01:01:01,423 --> 01:01:03,763
- I like how we met here.
- Yes.

1300
01:01:05,663 --> 01:01:07,602
I have a question.

1301
01:01:07,603 --> 01:01:08,663
What is it?

1302
01:01:09,373 --> 01:01:11,232
Did you tell your parents?

1303
01:01:11,233 --> 01:01:12,802
Yes. My parents.

1304
01:01:12,803 --> 01:01:14,873
I told them as soon as they got back from overseas.

1305
01:01:15,813 --> 01:01:17,772
- But...
- Of course, she's worried.

1306
01:01:17,773 --> 01:01:18,883
Gosh. What did they say?

1307
01:01:19,483 --> 01:01:21,413
My parents are really cool.

1308
01:01:22,653 --> 01:01:23,682
They said,

1309
01:01:23,683 --> 01:01:26,683
"As long as you're happy, we're fine with it."

1310
01:01:27,223 --> 01:01:29,492
- Really?
- That was what they said.

1311
01:01:29,493 --> 01:01:31,323
I was really worried about it.

1312
01:01:31,753 --> 01:01:33,092
Yes, that's understandable.

1313
01:01:33,093 --> 01:01:34,592
I'm so glad to hear that.

1314
01:01:34,593 --> 01:01:37,733
Actually, they responded just the way I expected them to.

1315
01:01:38,193 --> 01:01:39,703
"We respect your decision."

1316
01:01:40,503 --> 01:01:43,403
They don't care whether the age gap is 11 years or 20 years.

1317
01:01:44,433 --> 01:01:45,433
"Twenty years."

1318
01:01:46,043 --> 01:01:47,172
(Yun So comforts Ju Hee.)

1319
01:01:47,173 --> 01:01:49,843
My parents told me they respect me.

1320
01:01:51,773 --> 01:01:53,013
Did you tell your parents?

1321
01:01:55,313 --> 01:01:56,852
To some extent.

1322
01:01:56,853 --> 01:01:57,853
(Hesitating)

1323
01:01:57,854 --> 01:02:00,294
- Of course, you'd be cautious.
- I told them to some extent.

1324
01:02:02,693 --> 01:02:05,823
I know you'll feel more pressure.

1325
01:02:06,093 --> 01:02:07,963
But I'm confident that I can handle it.

1326
01:02:08,593 --> 01:02:11,993
In this aspect, I have a lot to learn from you.

1327
01:02:13,303 --> 01:02:15,262
So, I'm excited about our future together.

1328
01:02:15,263 --> 01:02:17,603
(I'm excited about our future together.)

1329
01:02:17,773 --> 01:02:19,693
What would have happened if you hadn't shown up?

1330
01:02:24,013 --> 01:02:25,612
Is it cold? You can wear the jacket.

1331
01:02:25,613 --> 01:02:26,642
(35-year-old Ju Hee and 24-year-old Yun So)

1332
01:02:26,643 --> 01:02:27,813
Do you want to put it on?

1333
01:02:28,913 --> 01:02:30,313
We can't let go of our hands.

1334
01:02:31,783 --> 01:02:33,353
What do you want for dinner?

1335
01:02:33,523 --> 01:02:34,882
They look so good together.

1336
01:02:34,883 --> 01:02:36,422
- A mala dish?
- A mala dish?

1337
01:02:36,423 --> 01:02:37,892
- Let's have a mala dish.
- Okay.

1338
01:02:37,893 --> 01:02:39,692
(We have a new couple with an 11-year age gap.)

1339
01:02:39,693 --> 01:02:42,022
Gosh. I'm so jealous that it hurts.

1340
01:02:42,023 --> 01:02:43,832
(She couldn't hold back her true feelings.)

1341
01:02:43,833 --> 01:02:45,393
(That's totally understandable.)

1342
01:02:47,133 --> 01:02:50,833
(Another spot to meet in 7 days)

1343
01:02:53,843 --> 01:02:55,872
Yu Jin and Si Won.

1344
01:02:55,873 --> 01:02:59,282
(Yu Jin and Si Won have promised to meet...)

1345
01:02:59,283 --> 01:03:00,382
(at 9pm at Eonju Station.)

1346
01:03:00,383 --> 01:03:02,583
- Eonju Station.
- At 9pm at Eonju Station.

1347
01:03:04,083 --> 01:03:06,953
(Will they be able to meet again?)

1348
01:03:07,783 --> 01:03:10,353
(Their last conversation 7 days ago at the Yeon House.)

1349
01:03:10,453 --> 01:03:13,192
What are you going to tell your parents?

1350
01:03:13,193 --> 01:03:15,732
- To them? I'll show the photo.
- You'll show them our photo.

1351
01:03:15,733 --> 01:03:17,233
- And go, "What do you think?" - Yes.

1352
01:03:17,363 --> 01:03:20,833
I don't know how they'll respond after hearing how old I am.

1353
01:03:22,103 --> 01:03:23,343
- I don't know either.
- Right.

1354
01:03:23,703 --> 01:03:24,832
Gosh. The 12-year age gap.

1355
01:03:24,833 --> 01:03:26,003
Should we not tell them?

1356
01:03:27,343 --> 01:03:30,813
Of course, they'll be surprised at first, right?

1357
01:03:31,213 --> 01:03:32,942
They were very worried.

1358
01:03:32,943 --> 01:03:34,043
So...

1359
01:03:34,413 --> 01:03:39,123
What are you thinking? Are you willing...

1360
01:03:40,523 --> 01:03:43,493
to see me outside the Yeon House?

1361
01:03:43,993 --> 01:03:46,162
Yes. I'll be there in a week.

1362
01:03:46,163 --> 01:03:47,263
Is that so?

1363
01:03:47,593 --> 01:03:49,733
Honestly, I believe...

1364
01:03:51,233 --> 01:03:54,232
what happens in a week is the real deal.

1365
01:03:54,233 --> 01:03:56,432
- Right. I also think...
- Yes.

1366
01:03:56,433 --> 01:03:59,002
- that's the time we start...
- We'll get to know each other.

1367
01:03:59,003 --> 01:04:01,372
- to really keep in touch.
- We'll start...

1368
01:04:01,373 --> 01:04:02,812
to really get to know each other.

1369
01:04:02,813 --> 01:04:03,912
(Will they be able to meet again?)

1370
01:04:03,913 --> 01:04:05,273
I like how we're on the same page.

1371
01:04:08,113 --> 01:04:11,813
(The meeting time is approaching before we know it.)

1372
01:04:17,253 --> 01:04:18,422
(Si Won shows up as promised.)

1373
01:04:18,423 --> 01:04:20,493
Si Won, who said he'd come,

1374
01:04:20,663 --> 01:04:22,632
comes to the meeting spot first.

1375
01:04:22,633 --> 01:04:23,833
- Yes.
- He kept his promise.

1376
01:04:24,563 --> 01:04:27,532
We both said that we'd show up...

1377
01:04:27,533 --> 01:04:28,903
no matter what.

1378
01:04:31,203 --> 01:04:32,563
I think she'll definitely show up.

1379
01:04:34,403 --> 01:04:37,543
I know he would've thought much about it,

1380
01:04:38,173 --> 01:04:39,443
but he's really here.

1381
01:04:41,683 --> 01:04:43,553
And he brought the photo they took together.

1382
01:04:44,383 --> 01:04:47,323
(Nervous)

1383
01:04:49,153 --> 01:04:50,153
(Will Yu Jin keep her promise to Si Won?)

1384
01:04:50,154 --> 01:04:51,853
Now, only Yun Jin needs to show up.

1385
01:04:54,863 --> 01:04:57,192
(Meanwhile, at the meeting spot of Jin Wu and Jin Young...)

1386
01:04:57,193 --> 01:04:58,262
What?

1387
01:04:58,263 --> 01:04:59,603
Is this a different spot?

1388
01:04:59,803 --> 01:05:02,803
(It's a photo studio.)

1389
01:05:03,803 --> 01:05:05,132
Jin Wu will definitely come.

1390
01:05:05,133 --> 01:05:09,343
(Will the two show up at the meeting spot?)

1391
01:05:10,413 --> 01:05:11,672
(Jin Wu shows up first.)

1392
01:05:11,673 --> 01:05:14,043
Jin Wu is a guy who stands firm.

1393
01:05:15,813 --> 01:05:18,383
(Nervous)

1394
01:05:21,483 --> 01:05:24,293
(Jin Wu looks especially nervous.)

1395
01:05:25,653 --> 01:05:27,723
(Sighing)

1396
01:05:32,063 --> 01:05:33,562
(Their last conversation 7 days ago at the Yeon House)

1397
01:05:33,563 --> 01:05:35,463
Here is what I'm worried about.

1398
01:05:35,833 --> 01:05:38,202
You have strong feelings for me,

1399
01:05:38,203 --> 01:05:40,343
but mine aren't as strong.

1400
01:05:40,943 --> 01:05:43,513
Our feelings are on very different levels.

1401
01:05:44,043 --> 01:05:45,983
So, I...

1402
01:05:46,983 --> 01:05:48,013
So,

1403
01:05:49,483 --> 01:05:53,523
I don't have a huge crush on you yet,

1404
01:05:54,383 --> 01:05:57,893
but I wanted to get to know you a little more.

1405
01:05:58,893 --> 01:06:00,263
I was curious about you.

1406
01:06:00,723 --> 01:06:03,892
That was why, when it comes to you...

1407
01:06:03,893 --> 01:06:05,562
I chose you...

1408
01:06:05,563 --> 01:06:09,273
to meet you again and get to know more about you.

1409
01:06:13,573 --> 01:06:16,742
But while the level of your feelings is up here,

1410
01:06:16,743 --> 01:06:18,213
mine is down here.

1411
01:06:18,613 --> 01:06:21,512
What if you get hurt by this difference later on?

1412
01:06:21,513 --> 01:06:24,013
They kept me worried.

1413
01:06:24,653 --> 01:06:26,553
She might feel sorry at the beginning...

1414
01:06:26,683 --> 01:06:28,963
because only one person has expressed his feelings a lot.

1415
01:06:29,923 --> 01:06:34,723
(Jin Wu felt anxious until the last moment.)

1416
01:06:35,723 --> 01:06:37,992
(In 7 days, has the level of Jin Young's feelings changed?)

1417
01:06:37,993 --> 01:06:40,003
Please, Jin Young.

1418
01:06:41,403 --> 01:06:42,533
Please.

1419
01:06:44,973 --> 01:06:47,442
(Meanwhile, Yu Jin hasn't shown up yet.)

1420
01:06:47,443 --> 01:06:49,412
- I think Yu Jin will come.
- Yu Jin.

1421
01:06:49,413 --> 01:06:50,913
You never know, though.

1422
01:06:53,683 --> 01:06:54,712
(It's 30 minutes past the meeting time.)

1423
01:06:54,713 --> 01:06:56,353
Is it 30 minutes past the time?

1424
01:06:57,453 --> 01:06:58,512
(But Yu Jin is nowhere to be found.)

1425
01:06:58,513 --> 01:07:00,783
No. They have to be matched.

1426
01:07:02,083 --> 01:07:03,153
Why isn't she coming?

1427
01:07:11,193 --> 01:07:13,432
(The more he waits, the more anxious he gets.)

1428
01:07:13,433 --> 01:07:15,103
Don't tell me. No.

1429
01:07:20,803 --> 01:07:23,842
(It's way past the meeting time, )

1430
01:07:23,843 --> 01:07:27,213
(but Yu Jin doesn't show up.)

1431
01:07:27,543 --> 01:07:30,012
- No. They have to become a couple.
- No way.

1432
01:07:30,013 --> 01:07:32,722
I want to see the two smile together.

1433
01:07:32,723 --> 01:07:34,583
They had such beautiful smiles.

1434
01:07:40,523 --> 01:07:42,863
Hold on. Come on. This isn't true.

1435
01:07:43,493 --> 01:07:45,492
Is this really happening?

1436
01:07:45,493 --> 01:07:47,803
Ju Hee showed up late too.

1437
01:07:49,033 --> 01:07:52,573
(Sighing)

1438
01:07:54,903 --> 01:07:56,542
- Was she worried a lot?
- Gosh.

1439
01:07:56,543 --> 01:07:57,912
- Oh, no.
- Was Yu Jin worried?

1440
01:07:57,913 --> 01:07:59,243
She's not coming.

1441
01:08:03,713 --> 01:08:05,712
(He keeps on waiting, but...)

1442
01:08:05,713 --> 01:08:06,823
No way.

1443
01:08:07,223 --> 01:08:08,353
She really didn't show up.

1444
01:08:08,883 --> 01:08:13,363
(In the end, he leaves the spot by himself.)

1445
01:08:13,523 --> 01:08:14,922
Really?

1446
01:08:14,923 --> 01:08:15,962
(Did she really not show up?)

1447
01:08:15,963 --> 01:08:21,062
(Everyone is left in silence by the unbelievable result.)

1448
01:08:21,063 --> 01:08:22,563
Come on, Yu Jin.

1449
01:08:23,203 --> 01:08:24,473
Seriously?

1450
01:08:24,903 --> 01:08:26,473
How could this be?

1451
01:08:28,643 --> 01:08:30,842
(Yu Jin couldn't keep her promise after 7 days.)

1452
01:08:30,843 --> 01:08:34,443
Goodness. Si Won is going back in the end.

1453
01:08:36,053 --> 01:08:42,553
(Why did Yu Jin change her mind?)

1454
01:08:47,093 --> 01:08:48,993
I can't think of the reasons...

1455
01:08:49,933 --> 01:08:51,532
why you didn't show up.

1456
01:08:51,533 --> 01:08:54,003
But I believe you have your reasons, Yu Jin.

1457
01:08:54,133 --> 01:08:56,833
I want to be good friends later on.

1458
01:08:59,643 --> 01:09:01,003
That's all for me.

1459
01:09:05,843 --> 01:09:07,383
Ultimately, I have...

1460
01:09:08,183 --> 01:09:13,123
chosen not to make a final decision.

1461
01:09:14,023 --> 01:09:18,153
I think the final decision felt like a heavy responsibility to me.

1462
01:09:18,623 --> 01:09:23,633
I just want to get to know him in a lighthearted way.

1463
01:09:23,733 --> 01:09:26,263
So for me to go to him feeling like this...

1464
01:09:26,503 --> 01:09:31,403
and declare that we're a couple...

1465
01:09:31,773 --> 01:09:34,843
was something I didn't feel was fair to Si Won.

1466
01:09:35,703 --> 01:09:41,112
Since I was older, I felt it was only right that I didn't go to him.

1467
01:09:41,113 --> 01:09:44,213
That's why I chose not to make a final decision.

1468
01:09:47,183 --> 01:09:48,752
I see.

1469
01:09:48,753 --> 01:09:51,622
(Yu Jin and Si Won, the couple with a 12-year age gap, didn't work out.)

1470
01:09:51,623 --> 01:09:54,662
For some couples, an age gap means nothing.

1471
01:09:54,663 --> 01:09:56,462
But for others,

1472
01:09:56,463 --> 01:10:00,062
it can be a huge obstacle.

1473
01:10:00,063 --> 01:10:02,223
(For some couples, an age gap can be a huge obstacle.)

1474
01:10:03,833 --> 01:10:05,732
(Meanwhile, Jin Young still hasn't shown up.)

1475
01:10:05,733 --> 01:10:07,303
Gosh. Please.

1476
01:10:15,613 --> 01:10:17,353
I guess she's not coming.

1477
01:10:19,213 --> 01:10:21,153
Goodness.

1478
01:10:21,553 --> 01:10:24,823
(Jin Wu still waits with hope.)

1479
01:10:25,723 --> 01:10:27,192
It's just two couples.

1480
01:10:27,193 --> 01:10:30,133
I feel like she'd show up with a big smile. Maybe not.

1481
01:10:31,263 --> 01:10:33,632
(Did Jin Young's feelings not change?)

1482
01:10:33,633 --> 01:10:35,833
- She's not coming.
- I'm sad.

1483
01:10:36,473 --> 01:10:38,933
(Sighing)

1484
01:10:44,843 --> 01:10:46,183
(Smiling brightly)

1485
01:10:47,143 --> 01:10:48,383
Hey.

1486
01:10:48,443 --> 01:10:49,452
She's here! She came!

1487
01:10:49,453 --> 01:10:51,312
- What?
- She's here!

1488
01:10:51,313 --> 01:10:54,123
Jin Young, what took you so long?

1489
01:10:55,523 --> 01:10:56,523
(Smiling)

1490
01:10:56,524 --> 01:10:58,492
Jin Young showed up for him.

1491
01:10:58,493 --> 01:11:00,092
Right.

1492
01:11:00,093 --> 01:11:01,539
(Jin Young rushes over to Jin Wu when she sees him.)

1493
01:11:01,563 --> 01:11:03,562
(The two kept their promise from 7 days ago.)

1494
01:11:03,563 --> 01:11:04,763
Hey.

1495
01:11:04,993 --> 01:11:06,733
Did you wait for me? Let me see.

1496
01:11:06,863 --> 01:11:07,903
Are you crying?

1497
01:11:11,003 --> 01:11:12,332
Were you waiting for me?

1498
01:11:12,333 --> 01:11:13,373
(Tearing up)

1499
01:11:13,673 --> 01:11:15,343
Are you crying?

1500
01:11:15,743 --> 01:11:17,442
- You're not crying, are you?
- I'm not.

1501
01:11:17,443 --> 01:11:19,113
Jin Wu was shocked.

1502
01:11:19,413 --> 01:11:20,643
You look even better now.

1503
01:11:21,743 --> 01:11:23,183
You look handsome today.

1504
01:11:23,683 --> 01:11:25,153
Why did you get here so late?

1505
01:11:25,753 --> 01:11:26,953
Did you wait long?

1506
01:11:27,783 --> 01:11:29,323
He's close to tears right now.

1507
01:11:29,653 --> 01:11:31,023
You lost so much weight.

1508
01:11:31,223 --> 01:11:32,452
I've been through a lot emotionally.

1509
01:11:32,453 --> 01:11:34,093
You've been through a lot emotionally?

1510
01:11:34,363 --> 01:11:35,892
I should feed you more...

1511
01:11:35,893 --> 01:11:37,062
so you can put on some weight.

1512
01:11:37,063 --> 01:11:38,983
- Let's go inside.
- Let's go and take pictures.

1513
01:11:39,263 --> 01:11:40,602
What's going on with you?

1514
01:11:40,603 --> 01:11:41,862
(Jin Young comforts Jin Wu.)

1515
01:11:41,863 --> 01:11:43,633
Goodness.

1516
01:11:44,603 --> 01:11:47,803
Why are you shaking so much?

1517
01:11:50,113 --> 01:11:51,812
- Why are you about to cry?
- I'm not crying.

1518
01:11:51,813 --> 01:11:53,213
Why did you get here so late?

1519
01:11:53,483 --> 01:11:55,042
Did you think I wasn't coming?

1520
01:11:55,043 --> 01:11:56,453
I didn't think you were coming.

1521
01:11:58,913 --> 01:12:00,123
Can you hold my hand?

1522
01:12:00,283 --> 01:12:02,052
- You look pretty today.
- What?

1523
01:12:02,053 --> 01:12:03,293
I look pretty today?

1524
01:12:03,453 --> 01:12:04,853
- Am I pretty?
- You're pretty.

1525
01:12:05,893 --> 01:12:07,973
- My nose is running.
- We're taking pictures today.

1526
01:12:08,923 --> 01:12:10,293
- Jin Wu.
- Yes?

1527
01:12:10,963 --> 01:12:12,962
- I'm good. I feel good.
- You feel good?

1528
01:12:12,963 --> 01:12:15,663
I feel like I'm dreaming right now.

1529
01:12:18,073 --> 01:12:20,353
You really thought about things a lot over the past week.

1530
01:12:20,943 --> 01:12:22,463
Yes, you were all I could think about.

1531
01:12:23,343 --> 01:12:25,913
Really? For me,

1532
01:12:26,383 --> 01:12:28,812
I actually had to go back to work the very next day.

1533
01:12:28,813 --> 01:12:29,813
So...

1534
01:12:30,113 --> 01:12:32,882
I barely had time to think about...

1535
01:12:32,883 --> 01:12:35,153
what happened at Yeon House.

1536
01:12:35,753 --> 01:12:37,593
But more and more,

1537
01:12:38,453 --> 01:12:41,193
I found myself wanting to talk to you.

1538
01:12:41,323 --> 01:12:42,822
Wanting to hang out with you.

1539
01:12:42,823 --> 01:12:44,392
Goodness.

1540
01:12:44,393 --> 01:12:45,792
Thinking about things that we'd have fun doing together.

1541
01:12:45,793 --> 01:12:48,663
I kept having these thoughts.

1542
01:12:49,903 --> 01:12:52,773
I actually already planned out...

1543
01:12:53,043 --> 01:12:54,372
what we should do today...

1544
01:12:54,373 --> 01:12:56,442
after we take the pictures.

1545
01:12:56,443 --> 01:12:58,203
We can do them all. I won't go home tonight.

1546
01:12:58,443 --> 01:12:59,742
I mean, you should still go home.

1547
01:12:59,743 --> 01:13:00,943
I'll head home after sunrise.

1548
01:13:01,013 --> 01:13:02,313
I'll take the first subway home.

1549
01:13:02,443 --> 01:13:04,783
Anyway, I kept wanting to spend time with you.

1550
01:13:04,813 --> 01:13:06,953
The more I thought about it, the more I realized...

1551
01:13:07,383 --> 01:13:08,923
how comfortable I felt with you.

1552
01:13:09,423 --> 01:13:11,553
- Right.
- And...

1553
01:13:11,953 --> 01:13:14,663
I was really grateful for how you always took care of me.

1554
01:13:15,763 --> 01:13:18,093
I think what I loved most was...

1555
01:13:18,393 --> 01:13:21,033
how consistently you...

1556
01:13:21,133 --> 01:13:22,363
looked out for me.

1557
01:13:22,733 --> 01:13:25,033
At the end, you said...

1558
01:13:26,503 --> 01:13:27,702
Gosh, I can't believe they worked out.

1559
01:13:27,703 --> 01:13:31,813
That it felt like I was moving at a completely different speed.

1560
01:13:31,843 --> 01:13:34,213
But I want you to believe this one thing.

1561
01:13:35,443 --> 01:13:39,013
I'm not someone who suddenly gets passionate...

1562
01:13:39,553 --> 01:13:41,183
and then cools off.

1563
01:13:41,753 --> 01:13:43,722
I'm just someone who always has a warm heart.

1564
